    "title": "San Antonio Startup and Tech Week Returns for 11th Year With Free Downtown Events - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Susan O'Brien ,\n1 days ago San Antonio Startup and Tech Week kicks off this year with a new name, a five-day run of free programming, and events scattered across downtown venues from Texas Public Radio to the Central Library. The rebrand reflects a shift toward the city's growing base of developers, engineers, cybersecurity experts and AI builders, who take center stage in this year's program. Read full article",
